  "body": "Recent pushes on the costing feature branches left the review branch without the intended costing surface. This PR restores the invoicing-side costing UI so the requested feature is present and reviewable.\n\n- **Invoicing surface**\n  - Adds a dedicated **Costing** tab to `/invoicing`\n  - Mounts the new cost intelligence workspace alongside existing invoice/contract flows\n  - Keeps the change scoped to the invoicing entry point rather than spreading costing logic across multiple pages\n\n- **Cost intelligence panel**\n  - Introduces `CostIntelligencePanel` as a focused feature component\n  - Aggregates:\n    - provider run-rate inputs\n    - per-organization live cost / bill-back metrics\n    - per-user unit cost and bill-back hierarchy\n  - Supports organization selection and a direct handoff to `/pricing`\n\n- **Regression coverage**\n  - Extends `InvoicingPage` tests to cover:\n    - presence of the new costing tab\n    - rendering of cost intelligence metrics from mocked billing/shift/user data\n\n```tsx\n<TabsTrigger value=\"costing\" className=\"gap-1.5 text-xs\">\n  <DollarSign className=\"h-3.5 w-3.5\" />\n  Costing\n</TabsTrigger>\n\n<TabsContent value=\"costing\" className=\"mt-4\">\n  <CostIntelligencePanel\n    isClientBillingUser={isClientBillingUser}\n    financeEnabled={financeEnabled}\n  />\n</TabsContent>\n```\n\n> [!WARNING]\n>\n> <details>\n> <summary>Firewall rules blocked me from connecting to one or more addresses (expand for details)</summary>\n>\n> #### I tried to connect to the following addresses, but was blocked by firewall rules:\n>\n> - `api.runpod.ai`\n>   - Triggering command: `/opt/hostedtoolcache/node/22.22.2/x64/bin/node node scripts/run-test-with-bob-assist.mjs -- vitest run src/pages/InvoicingPage.test.tsx` (dns block)\n>\n> If you need me to access, download, or install something from one of these locations, you can either:\n>\n> - Configure [Actions setup steps](https://gh.io/copilot/actions-setup-steps) to set up my environment, which run before the firewall is enabled\n> - Add the appropriate URLs or hosts to the custom allowlist in this repository's [Copilot coding agent settings](https://github.com/DonSquires/FreedomCamp-Manager/settings/copilot/coding_agent) (admins only)\n>\n> </details>\n\n<!-- START COPILOT ORIGINAL PROMPT -->\n\n\n\n<details>\n\n<summary>Original prompt</summary>\n\n> feat/costing-surface-fresh had recent pushes 31 minutes ago\n> copilot/vscode-mpdme0bw-dnzn had recent pushes 18 minutes ago : gh is asking for review and pall for theses feat\n> \n> The user has attached the following file paths as relevant context:\n>  - .github/copilot-instructions.md\n\n\n</details>\n\n\n\n<!-- START COPILOT CODING AGENT SUFFIX -->\n\nCreated from [VS Code](https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/copilot/copilot-coding-agent).",
